          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho bebuthela ndawonye isiliva nethusi nensimbi nomthofu nethini phakathi kwesithando ukuze kuvuthelwe umlilo phezu kwakho futhi kuncibilike; ngiyakunibutha ngentukuthelo yami nangokufutheka kwami, nginishiye khona, nginincibilikise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.20",
