          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abapristi balo beqile umthetho wami, bangcolisa izinto zami ezingcwele; abenzanga mahluko phakathi kokungcwele nokungcolile, abenzanga mahluko phakathi kokungcolileyo nokuhlambulukileyo, bafihla amehlo abo kumasabatha ami, ngingcolisiwe phakathi kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
