              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaprofethi bawo bazinameke ngodaka olulukhuni, bebona ngeze, beprofetha amanga kubo, bethi: Isho kanje iNkosi uJehova, uJehova engakhulumanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.28",
