          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngafuna phakathi kwabo umuntu ongakha uthango, eme esikhaleni phambi kwami ngenxa yezwe, ukuze ngingalichithi; kodwa angitholanga lutho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
